   "blurb": "Stage 1 of the pipeline. 15 minutes, every pack.",
   "body": "# Tender Intake Checklist (Stage 1 — 15 minutes)\n\n| Field | Entry |\n|---|---|\n| Tender number | |\n| Title / description | |\n| Buyer (organ of state) | |\n| Framework | PFMA / MFMA |\n| Bid form family | SBD / MBD |\n| Procurement type | RFI / RFQ / RFP / RFB / EOI |\n| Estimated value / band | |\n| Preference system indicated | 80/20 / 90/10 / not stated |\n| Pre-qualification criteria | |\n| CIDB designation required | grade + class + \"or higher\"? |\n| Compulsory briefing | Yes/No · date · time · venue |\n| Clarification question deadline | |\n| Closing date and time | |\n| Submission method | physical address / portal / email |\n| Number of copies / format | |\n| Bid validity period | |\n| Document fee | |\n| Buyer contact — technical | |\n| Buyer contact — administrative | |\n| Date pack downloaded | |\n| Corrigenda checked on (date) | |\n| Source pack saved to | 00-source-pack/ |\n\n**Immediate actions**\n- [ ] Diarise briefing, question deadline and closing (with a D-3 internal cut-off)\n- [ ] Save unmodified pack to `00-source-pack/`\n- [ ] Log in `worklog/tender-log.csv`\n- [ ] Proceed to Eligibility Determination\n"
