   "blurb": "The written go/no-go gate. Nothing asserted without a source.",
   "body": "# Eligibility Determination\n\n**Tender:** <number> — <title>\n**Closing:** <date/time>\n**Prepared by / date:** \n\n## 1. Requirements\n| Requirement | Source (clause/page) |\n|---|---|\n| CIDB designation | |\n| Registrations / accreditations | |\n| Pre-qualification criteria | |\n| Value limit relevance | |\n| Other eligibility conditions | |\n\n## 2. Client position\n| Item | Client status | Verified how / on what date | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Legal entity + reg no | | | |\n| CIDB grade/class/status (CRS no.) | | | |\n| CSD registration | | | |\n| Tax compliance status | | | |\n| Required registrations | | | |\n| Restricted supplier check | | | |\n\n## 3. Verdict\n**ELIGIBLE / NOT ELIGIBLE / ELIGIBLE SUBJECT TO <condition>**\n\n**Reasoning**\n1. \n2. \n3. \n\n## 4. Options if not eligible\n- [ ] Do not bid\n- [ ] Joint venture — partner requirements and JV calculator output:\n- [ ] Upgrade feasibility before closing (realistic? evidence?)\n\n## 5. Unverified items\n- `MISSING — CLIENT TO PROVIDE`: \n\n> Nothing in this determination is asserted without a source. Items stated by the client but not independently verified are marked \"client-stated\".\n"
